<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Atlas Bot</title>

<style>
body{
margin:0;
font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
background:#0d1117;
color:white;
text-align:center;
}

header{
padding:80px 20px;
background:#161b22;
}

h1{
font-size:60px;
margin:0;
color:#5865F2;
}

p{
font-size:20px;
max-width:700px;
margin:auto;
line-height:1.6;
}

.button{
display:inline-block;
margin-top:30px;
padding:15px 35px;
background:#5865F2;
color:white;
text-decoration:none;
border-radius:10px;
font-size:18px;
}

section{
padding:60px 20px;
}

.card{
background:#161b22;
padding:20px;
margin:20px auto;
max-width:700px;
border-radius:12px;
}

footer{
padding:30px;
background:#161b22;
color:#888;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
<h1>🌍 Atlas Bot</h1>

<p>
Atlas Bot is your all-in-one Discord companion, providing powerful moderation,
automation, utilities, giveaways, reaction roles, and much more.
</p>

<a class="button" href="#">Invite Atlas</a>
</header>

<section>

<h2>Features</h2>

<div class="card">
🛡️ Advanced Moderation
</div>

<div class="card">
🤖 Auto Moderation
</div>

<div class="card">
🎉 Giveaways
</div>

<div class="card">
🎭 Reaction Roles
</div>

<div class="card">
📊 Server Utilities
</div>

<div class="card">
🚀 Constant Updates
</div>

</section>

<section id="terms">

<h2>Terms of Service</h2>

<p>
By using Atlas Bot, you agree to follow Discord's Terms of Service.
Atlas Bot is provided "as is" and may change at any time.
</p>

</section>

<section id="privacy">

<h2>Privacy Policy</h2>

<p>
Atlas Bot may store Discord IDs and server settings required for its features.
Atlas Bot does not sell your data or collect passwords or payment information.
</p>

</section>

<footer>

© 2026 Atlas Bot

<br><br>

Not affiliated with Discord Inc.

</footer>

</body>
</html>
